1
00:00:03,714 --> 00:00:06,785
我不記得家里有買新鮮的蜜桃小翹臀啊
I don't remember buying these fresh peaches.

2
00:00:08,135 --> 00:00:09,755
抱歉 瑟奇
Apologies, Serge.

3
00:00:09,755 --> 00:00:11,195
我妻子克萊爾似乎忘記了
My wife, Claire, seems to have forgotten

4
00:00:11,195 --> 00:00:12,315
我在家里辦公
that I'm holding office hours

5
00:00:12,315 --> 00:00:14,705
讓房地產入門課的學生來學習
for my Intro to Real Estate class here at home.

6
00:00:14,705 --> 00:00:16,585
所以我十分鐘前
So, when I walked to the laundry room

7
00:00:16,585 --> 00:00:17,915
只穿著文胸進洗衣房時...
10 minutes ago in my bra...

8
00:00:17,915 --> 00:00:19,085
時機倒是再合適不過了
That was kind of perfect, actually.

9
00:00:19,085 --> 00:00:21,595
我剛給他講完 七十年代早期的"建筑"
I had just made a point about how buildings from the early '70s

10
00:00:21,595 --> 00:00:23,535
至今仍出人意料地"堅挺"
were holding up surprisingly well.

11
00:00:23,575 --> 00:00:24,635
或許我該...
So maybe I'll...

12
00:00:24,635 --> 00:00:25,865
-是啊 -是啊
- Yeah. - Yeah.

13
00:00:25,865 --> 00:00:27,886
上課時見 伙計
All right, see you in class, buddy.

14
00:00:28,456 --> 00:00:29,467
多好的孩子
What a great kid.

15
00:00:30,026 --> 00:00:32,936
這就是我獻身學術界的原因 克萊爾
That's why I chucked it all for a life in academia, Claire.

16
00:00:33,416 --> 00:00:34,626
這感覺太特別了
It's a special feeling

17
00:00:34,626 --> 00:00:36,856
知道這世界某處有個年輕人
knowing that there's a young man walking around out there

18
00:00:36,856 --> 00:00:39,716
是你幫忙打造他的品格 能讓你驕傲
who you helped mold, who you can be proud of.

19
00:00:39,716 --> 00:00:41,716
-爸 -你懂嗎
- Hey, Dad. - Hey. You know?

20
00:00:42,756 --> 00:00:43,817
你起得真早
You're up early.

21
00:00:44,146 --> 00:00:45,146
你這話什么意思
What are you talking about?

22
00:00:45,146 --> 00:00:46,666
剛才我還從背后抱你來著
I hugged you from behind earlier.

23
00:00:46,666 --> 00:00:49,357
我說"我不記得家里有買六塊腹肌[啤酒]啊"
You know, I said, "I don't remember buying this six pack."

24
00:00:49,357 --> 00:00:51,877
然后你用很搞笑的東歐口音說
Then you did that funny Eastern European accent --

25
00:00:51,877 --> 00:00:52,957
"我不想惹麻煩
"I don't want trouble.

26
00:00:52,957 --> 00:00:54,558
我只想學習"
I just want to learn."

27
00:00:54,687 --> 00:00:57,717
我們是否該擔憂一下集體性騷擾瑟奇的事
Should we be concerned about group-molesting Serge?

28
00:00:57,717 --> 00:00:59,577
而且你不是再少一個學生
And aren't you at the minimum number of students

29
00:00:59,577 --> 00:01:01,447
-課程就會被取消嗎 -不必擔心
- before they cancel your class? - Not to worry.

30
00:01:01,447 --> 00:01:03,867
瑟奇很崇拜我 班上其余同學也很靠譜
Serge worships me, and the rest of the class is super solid.

31
00:01:03,867 --> 00:01:05,837
再說 過了今天就不準棄課了
Plus, it's the last day to drop classes anyway.

32
00:01:05,837 --> 00:01:06,797
說到棄課
Oh, speaking of that,

33
00:01:06,797 --> 00:01:08,257
我在考慮放棄歷史課
I'm thinking about dropping history.

34
00:01:08,257 --> 00:01:10,588
-為什么 -我覺得很無趣
- How come? - It's not really exciting me.

35
00:01:10,648 --> 00:01:12,448
再說 有份大論文今天該交
Plus, we've got this huge paper due today

36
00:01:12,448 --> 00:01:14,488
我的開始動工計劃還沒結束
that I haven't quite finished starting.

37
00:01:14,608 --> 00:01:16,298
要寫門羅主義
It's on the Monroe Doctrine.

38
00:01:16,328 --> 00:01:18,278
門羅主義
The Monroe Doctrine?

39
00:01:18,278 --> 00:01:19,159
糟糕
Oh, no.

40
00:01:19,368 --> 00:01:21,218
大三歷史課
Junior year history class,

41
00:01:21,218 --> 00:01:23,148
我寫了一份完美的論文
I wrote the perfect paper.

42
00:01:23,148 --> 00:01:25,958
強力的論點 無可挑剔的輔助論證
Strong thesis, impeccable supporting arguments.

43
00:01:25,958 --> 00:01:28,498
我引用了一位白宮侍從的信件
I quoted from the letters of a White House footman

44
00:01:28,498 --> 00:01:31,119
他回憶道 門羅在浴缸中叫他
who recalled Monroe calling to him from the bath,

45
00:01:31,119 --> 00:01:33,809
"博勒加德 把我的馬褲給我
"Beauregard, fetch me my breeches.

46
00:01:33,809 --> 00:01:35,609
我想到了一個主義"
We have a doctrine!"

47
00:01:35,609 --> 00:01:37,289
我只得了C
I got a "C."

48
00:01:39,559 --> 00:01:41,229
你認為這成績合理是嗎
Oh, so you agree with that grade, huh?

49
00:01:42,489 --> 00:01:43,930
別把我當小孩哄
Don't patronize me.

50
00:01:59,060 --> 00:02:01,590
俱樂部的飲食變得清淡健康多了
The food at the club has gotten so much lighter and healthier.

51
00:02:01,590 --> 00:02:03,260
好幾個人心絞痛連續發作
We had a run of angina attacks,

52
00:02:03,260 --> 00:02:04,790
所以我們不得不重視心臟健康
so we had to go heart-healthy.

53
00:02:04,790 --> 00:02:06,940
我們在同一個周末先后失去了
We said goodbye to our social chairman, Herb,

54
00:02:06,940 --> 00:02:09,310
社交主席賀布和黃油噴泉
and our butter fountain in the same weekend.

55
00:02:09,310 --> 00:02:10,390
我很遺憾
Oh, I'm sorry.

56
00:02:10,390 --> 00:02:11,590
普里契特先生
Hey, Mr. Pritchett.

57
00:02:11,590 --> 00:02:12,641
您隨時可以結賬了
I'll take this when you're ready.

58
00:02:12,641 --> 00:02:14,151
-謝謝你 瑪利亞 -瑪利亞
- Thank you, Maria. - Oh, Maria,

59
00:02:14,151 --> 00:02:16,381
很美的名字 所以常被歌唱
that's a beautiful name. That's why it's often sung.

60
00:02:16,381 --> 00:02:17,921
但你不會唱的
But you're not going to --

61
00:02:17,921 --> 00:02:20,101
?萬福瑪利亞?
♪ Ave Maria ♪

62
00:02:20,101 --> 00:02:22,531
謝幕 行了 他們剛允許同性戀進門
And curtain. Okay, they just started letting gays in here.

63
00:02:22,531 --> 00:02:23,541
別讓他們后悔
Don't make them regret it.

64
00:02:23,541 --> 00:02:24,921
你或許也該告訴夏羅娜[歌名]
You might also wanna tell Sharona

65
00:02:24,921 --> 00:02:26,971
-不要靠近這張桌子 -沒錯
- to steer clear of the table. - Yes.

66
00:02:26,971 --> 00:02:28,811
反正我或許也該留著精力
Yeah, well, I should probably save my energy

67
00:02:28,811 --> 00:02:30,511
為今晚的演出做準備
for my performance tonight anyway.

68
00:02:30,511 --> 00:02:33,111
見鬼 歌洛莉亞和我買了票要去看...
Oh, darn. Gloria and I have tickets to, um...

69
00:02:34,802 --> 00:02:36,632
別擔心 杰 不用你去看
Don't worry, Jay. It's-it's not for you.

70
00:02:36,632 --> 00:02:38,562
太好了 我還真編不下去了
Oh, good. I didn't know where I was going with that.

71
00:02:38,562 --> 00:02:41,012
今晚是莉莉學校的募捐演出
Tonight is a fundraiser at Lily's school.

72
00:02:41,052 --> 00:02:43,002
我們在為孩子們募捐
We're, you know, raising money for the kids.

73
00:02:43,162 --> 00:02:45,162
歌唱與小品之夜
A night of song and sketch.

74
00:02:45,162 --> 00:02:47,172
所有孩子爸爸都要演出 或者說
All the dads are performing. Well...

75
00:02:47,452 --> 00:02:48,663
大多數爸爸
most of the dads.

76
00:02:48,702 --> 00:02:49,572
為你驕傲 兒子
Proud of you, son.

77
00:02:49,572 --> 00:02:50,912
我也不是徹底的勝利
Ah, it's not a complete victory.

78
00:02:50,912 --> 00:02:53,022
我還是得去看的
I still have to watch it, so...

79
00:02:53,022 --> 00:02:54,623
多謝你請客吃早飯 爸
Thanks for breakfast, Dad.

80
00:02:54,623 --> 00:02:56,573
我喜歡和你們倆共度時光
I love spending time with you two!

81
00:02:56,573 --> 00:02:59,393
我每個月在俱樂部有最低消費
Every month I've gotta burn off a minimum at the club,

82
00:02:59,393 --> 00:03:02,143
而我認識的每個人居然都沒空
and literally, everybody else I knew was busy.

83
00:03:02,143 --> 00:03:04,163
這也是為什么我送出的好多生日禮物
That's also why I give a lot of birthday presents

84
00:03:04,163 --> 00:03:05,613
都是俱樂部專賣店買的 馬克杯
from the pro-shop. You know, mugs

85
00:03:05,613 --> 00:03:08,193
遮陽帽 上面印著"跟我的推桿說去"
and visors that say "Kiss My Putter,"

86
00:03:08,193 --> 00:03:09,633
"挑逗我 小鳥球"
"Talk Birdie To Me."

87
00:03:09,633 --> 00:03:12,883
都是好產品 雙贏
Quality items. Everybody wins.

88
00:03:13,023 --> 00:03:14,223
假如你們不著急的話
So, if you're not rushed,

89
00:03:14,223 --> 00:03:16,004
該去我們的水療享受一下
you should treat yourself to our spa.

90
00:03:16,004 --> 00:03:17,385
去試試看...
You know, get a couple of, uh...

91
00:03:18,414 --> 00:03:20,624
標準按摩套餐
a couple of standard treatments.

92
00:03:20,624 --> 00:03:22,904
你真慷慨
Oh, well, you're so generous.

93
00:03:22,904 --> 00:03:25,034
我想說 我們圣誕時送你的這件襯衫
Might I say you look very handsome

94
00:03:25,034 --> 00:03:27,064
你穿著十分精神
in that shirt we gave you for Christmas.

95
00:03:27,064 --> 00:03:29,694
這款還有"皇后珊瑚粉" 糟糕
They also make it in "Queen's coral" -- oh, no.

96
00:03:29,904 --> 00:03:30,974
我是不是劇透了你的生日禮物
Did I spoil your birthday?

97
00:03:30,974 --> 00:03:32,304
聽起來是的
Sounds like you might.

98
00:03:35,444 --> 00:03:37,125
-什么事這么好笑 -不過是
- What's so funny? - Oh, it's just that

99
00:03:37,125 --> 00:03:38,655
我和學校的一個孩子媽互通電郵
I've been e-mailing this mom at school.

100
00:03:38,655 --> 00:03:40,215
我和她一起做志愿者
We both volunteer together.

101
00:03:40,215 --> 00:03:42,715
-你發電郵 -沒什么的 聽著
- You-you e-mail? - It's harmless. Listen.

102
00:03:42,715 --> 00:03:45,985
"杰 在天文館和你說笑很開心
"Hey, Jay, enjoyed laughing around the planetarium with you.

103
00:03:45,985 --> 00:03:47,805
你的笑話能把人笑到天外"
Your jokes were out of this world."

104
00:03:47,805 --> 00:03:49,895
好吧 假如沒有什么
Hm, okay. So, if it's so harmless,

105
00:03:49,895 --> 00:03:52,845
歌洛莉亞肯定也知道這位妙語撩騷的女士
I'm sure Gloria knows about this flirty quipstress.

106
00:03:52,845 --> 00:03:54,645
別添油加醋
Don't make something out of this.

107
00:03:54,645 --> 00:03:55,795
我的天
Oh, my God.

108
00:03:55,795 --> 00:03:57,465
所以他才穿了這件襯衫
That's why he's wearing the shirt.

109
00:03:57,495 --> 00:03:59,656
因為它能襯托出你的藍眼睛
Because it makes your blue eyes pop.

110
00:03:59,656 --> 00:04:02,666
我不會讓你們倆八婆把這潭水弄渾
I'm not letting you magpies dirty this up.

111
00:04:04,366 --> 00:04:05,266
"把車停在秋千那
"Park by the swings

112
00:04:05,266 --> 00:04:07,246
好幫你把東西拿進來"
so I can help you carry stuff in."

113
00:04:07,246 --> 00:04:08,566
"把車停在秋千那
"Park by the swings

114
00:04:08,566 --> 00:04:10,746
好幫你把東西拿"進"來"
so I can help you carry stuff in."

115
00:04:10,746 --> 00:04:12,596
你們這是抹黑 我走了
You're sullying this, and I'm leaving!

116
00:04:12,596 --> 00:04:14,716
-向你女朋友帶好 -她不是我女朋友
- Okay, well, say "Hi" to your girlfriend. - She's not my girlfriend.

117
00:04:14,716 --> 00:04:15,696
我們倆會配成一組的唯一理由
The only reason we're paired together

118
00:04:15,696 --> 00:04:17,346
就是因為我們的孩子在同一個閱讀小組
is because our kids are in the same reading group.

119
00:04:18,556 --> 00:04:19,638
去你們的
Damn it!

120
00:04:20,167 --> 00:04:21,287
我太喜歡我們的"哦喲喲"了
I love when we "Ooh."

121
00:04:21,287 --> 00:04:23,557
以前我們經常這樣 后來不了
We used to do that all the time, and then we stopped.

122
00:04:23,557 --> 00:04:24,918
-為什么 -我不知道
- Why? - I don't know.

123
00:04:27,507 --> 00:04:28,578
喬
Joe!

124
00:04:28,957 --> 00:04:30,667
為什么我在垃圾桶里
Why did I find your eye patch

125
00:04:30,667 --> 00:04:32,807
-發現了你的眼罩 -我不知道
- in the garbage? - I don't know.

126
00:04:32,807 --> 00:04:35,157
因為你又去扔了一張停車罰單嗎
Were you throwing away another parking ticket?

127
00:04:35,157 --> 00:04:36,477
你必須戴上
Okay, you have to put it on.

128
00:04:36,477 --> 00:04:38,947
為什么 我的弱視已經好了
Why? My lazy eye is fixed.

129
00:04:38,947 --> 00:04:40,978
好啦 有我在呢
Okay, I'm over here,

130
00:04:40,978 --> 00:04:43,198
再堅持一周
and it's only one more week.

131
00:04:43,198 --> 00:04:44,578
你看起來很硬漢
And you look tough,

132
00:04:44,578 --> 00:04:46,888
像個小戰神
like a little warlord.

133
00:04:47,128 --> 00:04:48,368
利亞姆的媽媽到了
Oh, that's Liam's mom.

134
00:04:48,368 --> 00:04:49,788
放學見
See you after school.

135
00:04:49,788 --> 00:04:51,678
好的寶貝 不過答應我
Okay, papi, but promise me

136
00:04:51,678 --> 00:04:54,188
你一整天都會乖乖
that you're going to wear the eye patch

137
00:04:54,188 --> 00:04:56,908
-戴眼罩 -我會戴的
- the whole day. - I will.

138
00:04:59,338 --> 00:05:01,499
真不敢相信你不信任我
I can't believe you don't trust me.

139
00:05:01,499 --> 00:05:02,689
兩天前
Two days ago,

140
00:05:02,689 --> 00:05:04,229
我抓到你想
I caught you trying to copy

141
00:05:04,229 --> 00:05:06,769
用打印機復印20美元
a $20 bill in the printer.

142
00:05:06,769 --> 00:05:09,069
爸爸說等我能自己賺錢[造錢]的時候
Dad says I get to pick what we watch on TV

143
00:05:09,069 --> 00:05:11,169
我就能決定我們看什么節目
when I start making my own money.

144
00:05:11,169 --> 00:05:12,350
上學去吧
Go to school.

145
00:05:13,939 --> 00:05:14,679
要是你們準備好了
If you guys are ready,

146
00:05:14,679 --> 00:05:16,019
我和胡里奧就開始了
me and Julio will get started.

147
00:05:16,019 --> 00:05:18,339
對了 你們是不是在校園操場遇到的呢
Oh, by any chance, did you guys meet down by the schoolyard?

148
00:05:18,339 --> 00:05:21,109
-? 我 ? -別 別 好了
- ♪ Me ♪ - No -- No. Okay.

149
00:05:23,100 --> 00:05:24,550
就是這里
Oh, that's the spot.

150
00:05:29,810 --> 00:05:31,170
現在我想起來為什么我們
Now I'm remembering why we haven't had

151
00:05:31,170 --> 00:05:33,670
蜜月之后就沒有一起做過按摩了
a couples massage since our honeymoon.

152
00:05:34,130 --> 00:05:35,551
阿魯巴[阿魯巴島]
Aruba.

153
00:05:35,690 --> 00:05:37,070
那不是我們度蜜月的地方
That's not where we went.

154
00:05:37,070 --> 00:05:38,920
那是他發出的噪音
That's the noise he made.

155
00:05:39,040 --> 00:05:41,870
阿 魯 巴
Arrruuuubaaaa.

156
00:05:41,870 --> 00:05:43,051
小卡 你能稍微
Cam, could you just...

157
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:45,321
稍微 噓
just...shh.

158
00:05:45,321 --> 00:05:47,141
-抱歉 -謝謝
- I'm sorry. - Thank you.

159
00:05:52,601 --> 00:05:54,411
好了 夠了 我今天就到這了
Okay, you know what? I'm gonna call it.

160
00:05:54,901 --> 00:05:57,001
-不做了 -怎么了 他太過火了嗎
- Mm-hmm. Nope. - What happened? Was he forward?

161
00:05:57,001 --> 00:05:57,881
不是 我只是無法
No, I just can't relax

162
00:05:57,881 --> 00:05:59,451
在你發出那些聲音的時候放松下來
with you making these noises.

163
00:05:59,451 --> 00:06:01,521
那我不發出那些聲音就放松不下來
Well, I can't relax without making the noises.

164
00:06:01,521 --> 00:06:03,411
所以我要走了 謝謝你 胡里奧
Which is why I'm leaving. Thank you, Julio,

165
00:06:03,411 --> 00:06:05,112
不好意思 我沒記住你的名字
and I'm sorry. I-I didn't catch your name.

166
00:06:05,112 --> 00:06:06,212
我叫啊喂嗎喂
It's A-weema-weh.

167
00:06:06,212 --> 00:06:08,622
祝你們倆好運
Good luck to you both. Okay.

168
00:06:11,752 --> 00:06:13,172
盧克 親愛的
Oh, Luke! Honey, hi.

169
00:06:13,172 --> 00:06:14,712
你好啊 媽 一切都好嗎
Hey, Mom. Everything all right?

170
00:06:14,712 --> 00:06:16,572
當然 我就是想過來看看
Of course. I just felt like making a stop

171
00:06:16,572 --> 00:06:19,212
社區大學的神圣殿堂
by the hallowed halls of community college.

172
00:06:19,522 --> 00:06:21,022
那些封條是怎么回事
What's with the police tape?

173
00:06:21,022 --> 00:06:22,442
有一些兄弟會的人想把
Oh, some frat guys decided

174
00:06:22,442 --> 00:06:24,662
院長的車開到火人節去
to drive the dean's office to Burning Man.

175
00:06:24,662 --> 00:06:26,553
好吧 反正
Okay. Well, anyhoo,

176
00:06:26,663 --> 00:06:27,833
既然來都來了
since we're here,

177
00:06:27,833 --> 00:06:29,423
在你棄掉歷史課之前
before you drop that history class,

178
00:06:29,423 --> 00:06:32,183
能不能把我以前的論文交上去呢
could you possibly turn in an old paper of mine?

179
00:06:32,183 --> 00:06:34,153
我想看看別人的評分
I would love to get a second opinion on it.

180
00:06:34,153 --> 00:06:35,034
當然
Sure,

181
00:06:35,243 --> 00:06:37,033
但是你知道你對我提了一個很奇怪的要求
but you know you just did something weird

182
00:06:37,033 --> 00:06:39,153
而我一個問題都沒多問吧
and I didn't ask a single follow-up question?

183
00:06:39,153 --> 00:06:39,863
對
Yeah.

184
00:06:39,863 --> 00:06:41,184
你欠我一次這樣的請求
You owe me one of those.

185
00:06:42,083 --> 00:06:44,263
你是怎么把以前的論文導進U盤里的
How'd you even get an old paper on a thumb drive?

186
00:06:44,263 --> 00:06:45,484
很容易...
It was easy.

187
00:06:46,143 --> 00:06:47,095
吧
Ish.

188
00:06:47,294 --> 00:06:50,184
那篇久遠的論文是老舊的格式
The old paper was on an old format,

189
00:06:50,184 --> 00:06:51,384
但是把幾臺老機器連接起來
but it was a simple matter

190
00:06:51,384 --> 00:06:53,324
就能很容易地得到
of stringing a couple of old machines together

191
00:06:53,324 --> 00:06:54,534
我需要的東西了
to get what I needed.

192
00:06:54,534 --> 00:06:55,835
好了
All right.

193
00:06:55,854 --> 00:06:57,414
我一直因為完美主義
Yes, I have been accused of having

194
00:06:57,414 --> 00:06:59,654
飽受詬病
a little problem with perfectionism...

195
00:06:59,654 --> 00:07:01,115
? 它在運作 ?
♪ It's working ♪

196
00:07:01,154 --> 00:07:04,264
但是我對于不公也有意見
...but I also have a little problem with injustice,

197
00:07:04,264 --> 00:07:07,564
就像某位美國總統
much as a certain U.S. President had a little problem

198
00:07:07,564 --> 00:07:09,455
對歐洲帝國主義的看法一樣 棒
with European Imperialism. Yes!

199
00:07:09,455 --> 00:07:11,555
當然當一個男人這么做的時候 那是教義
Of course when a man does it, it becomes a doctrine.

200
00:07:11,555 --> 00:07:12,935
而當一個女人這樣做
and when a woman does it,

201
00:07:12,935 --> 00:07:14,416
她就是歇斯底里
she's hysterical.

202
00:07:15,095 --> 00:07:17,545
我希望你們喜歡數"烏鴉"
I hope you guys like counting "crows".

203
00:07:17,835 --> 00:07:19,525
"一只烏鴉"[第三方契約]
Es-crows, that is.

204
00:07:20,735 --> 00:07:22,495
這已經成了熟悉的聲音
It had become a familiar sound --

205
00:07:22,495 --> 00:07:26,215
我的18個投入的學生笑聲合一
my 18 devoted students laughing as one.

206
00:07:26,215 --> 00:07:28,105
只是這次有些不對勁
Only something was different this time.

207
00:07:28,105 --> 00:07:30,386
聽起來像是17個
It sounded like 17.

208
00:07:30,386 --> 00:07:34,186
難道中間有人動搖了
Could it be that I had a wobbler in my midst?

209
00:07:34,186 --> 00:07:35,806
果然 佩奇·史蒂文斯
Sure enough, Paige Stevens

210
00:07:35,806 --> 00:07:37,846
正在翻閱課程目錄
was going through the course catalog.

211
00:07:37,846 --> 00:07:39,216
要是她走了 我的課程就不足最小人數
If I lost her, I'd be below my minimum

212
00:07:39,216 --> 00:07:40,636
這門課就會被停
and lose the class.

213
00:07:40,636 --> 00:07:42,286
為了其他17個追夢者
For the sake of those 17 dreamers,

214
00:07:42,286 --> 00:07:46,146
我別無選擇 只能施展我的鄧菲魅力
I had no choice but to unleash the Dunphy charm.

215
00:07:46,146 --> 00:07:47,986
-佩奇·史蒂文斯 -到
- Paige Stevens. - Present.

216
00:07:47,986 --> 00:07:50,117
我們已經點過名了 你表現得很好
Oh, we already did that part, and you nailed it.

217
00:07:50,117 --> 00:07:52,147
我昨天晚上讀了你的文章
I read your essay last night.

218
00:07:52,457 --> 00:07:54,777
你私下跟誰一起學習了
Whom did you study privately with?

219
00:07:54,777 --> 00:07:57,087
-不好意思你說什么 -別裝了 佩奇
- I'm sorry? - Come, now, Paige.

220
00:07:57,087 --> 00:07:59,407
你的見解 你的遣詞造句
Your insight, your grasp of the vernacular.

221
00:07:59,577 --> 00:08:00,537
是弗里蒙特嗎
W-Was it Freemont?

222
00:08:00,537 --> 00:08:01,947
還是某一位歐洲人
Or perhaps one of the Europeans?

223
00:08:01,947 --> 00:08:03,397
沙爾芬貝格
Scharfenbrugen?

224
00:08:03,487 --> 00:08:04,937
-不是 -當然不
- No. - Oh, of course not.

225
00:08:04,937 --> 00:08:08,007
他過著隱居的生活 多年沒有收學生了
He lives as a recluse. He hasn't taken students in years.

226
00:08:08,277 --> 00:08:09,197
我是想表達
I'm simply saying

227
00:08:09,197 --> 00:08:10,917
你天生的直覺
that your raw instincts

228
00:08:10,917 --> 00:08:12,648
可能是1994年允許傭金分割以來
may be the best thing to happen to real estate

229
00:08:12,648 --> 00:08:15,798
房地產界的最強福音
since the allowing of split commissions in 1994.

230
00:08:15,798 --> 00:08:16,948
你不是跟我們說那是
Didn't you tell us it was --

231
00:08:16,948 --> 00:08:18,768
我們就不能有一會兒
Can we for one moment

232
00:08:18,768 --> 00:08:21,112
能不是你的瑟奇個人秀嗎
have a break from the Serge show?!

233
00:08:21,112 --> 00:08:26,628
向我保證幾年后
Just promise me that in a few short years

234
00:08:26,628 --> 00:08:29,228
當你成為下一個弗萊德·鄧納姆時
when you become the next Fred Dunham,

235
00:08:29,518 --> 00:08:30,908
你會回來看我們
that you'll come visit us?

236
00:08:30,908 --> 00:08:32,038
你真的覺得
Do you really think...

237
00:08:32,038 --> 00:08:33,219
我不是覺得
I don't think.

238
00:08:33,219 --> 00:08:34,220
我知道會
I know.

239
00:08:36,009 --> 00:08:37,979
就是那兒 一點奉承
From there, it was a bit of flattery,

240
00:08:37,979 --> 00:08:39,689
一絲鼓勵
a dash of encouragement,

241
00:08:39,689 --> 00:08:42,539
佩奇就回心轉意了
and Paige was turned.

242
00:08:42,539 --> 00:08:43,749
讓我把我們的明星學員
So, if I could paraphrase

243
00:08:43,749 --> 00:08:46,029
剛才指出的點改述一下
what our star pupil just pointed out,

244
00:08:46,029 --> 00:08:47,919
有時候問題只是要
sometimes it's just a matter

245
00:08:47,919 --> 00:08:50,869
找到愿意買復式住宅的復式傻子
of finding the "Dupe" in "Duplex."

246
00:08:51,429 --> 00:08:53,079
那個聲音又出現了
And there it was again,

247
00:08:53,079 --> 00:08:54,510
那動聽的音樂
that sweet music --

248
00:08:54,510 --> 00:08:56,700
18個人的歡笑聲
18 people laughing.

249
00:08:56,920 --> 00:08:58,421
所有人下周再見
I'll see you all next week.

250
00:08:58,810 --> 00:09:00,001
肯定的
Definitely.

251
00:09:00,250 --> 00:09:02,450
還有 我會在家辦公
Oh, and I am holding office hours at my house,

252
00:09:02,450 --> 00:09:04,100
歡迎你們隨時來訪
so feel free to come by any time.

253
00:09:04,100 --> 00:09:05,401
沒問題
Oh, cool.

254
00:09:06,020 --> 00:09:06,971
你...
Oh, you --

255
00:09:07,510 --> 00:09:08,571
佩奇
Uh, Paige.

256
00:09:10,590 --> 00:09:13,340
"佩奇·鄧菲夫人"
"Mrs. Paige Dunphy"?

257
00:09:13,460 --> 00:09:14,702
詛咒啊
Curses.

258
00:09:14,721 --> 00:09:17,771
我鼓勵地太過了
I'd over-wooed my wobbler.

259
00:09:20,521 --> 00:09:21,791
我們今晚還一起吃晚餐嗎
Are we still on for dinner tonight?

260
00:09:21,791 --> 00:09:22,951
當然 我大概能在我外公的俱樂部
Yeah, I can probably get us in

261
00:09:22,951 --> 00:09:25,151
弄到打烊前用餐的座位名額
to the late seating at my grandpa's country club.

262
00:09:25,151 --> 00:09:26,521
你能等到六點半嗎
Can you hold off 'ti:30?

263
00:09:26,521 --> 00:09:27,841
其實 我在想
Actually, I thought

264
00:09:27,841 --> 00:09:29,921
也許我可以去你家給你做飯吃
maybe I could come over and cook for you.

265
00:09:29,921 --> 00:09:30,802
太棒了
Awesome.

266
00:09:32,701 --> 00:09:34,891
這不是我最喜歡的班級爸爸嗎
Hey, there's my favorite class dad!

267
00:09:34,891 --> 00:09:35,682
你好啊
Oh, hey. Hey.

268
00:09:35,682 --> 00:09:36,952
幫我系下圍裙 好嗎
Tie my apron, will you?

269
00:09:36,952 --> 00:09:38,043
我的榮幸
My pleasure.

270
00:09:38,392 --> 00:09:40,392
不 不是我的榮幸[舒服] 當然不是
Uh, not my -- not my pleasure, of course.

271
00:09:40,392 --> 00:09:41,643
這聽起來太奇怪了
That sounds weird,

272
00:09:41,742 --> 00:09:43,202
而我不是奇怪的人
and I'm not a weird man.

273
00:09:43,202 --> 00:09:44,892
米奇和小卡攪亂了我的心
Mitch and Cam got in my head.

274
00:09:44,892 --> 00:09:48,392
我本來和那個有趣媽媽有一段完全無害的關系
I'd had a perfectly innocent relationship with the fun mom,

275
00:09:48,392 --> 00:09:50,342
結果被他們弄得我老有負罪感
but then they got me feeling all guilty.

276
00:09:50,342 --> 00:09:52,522
突然間我在學校提到的每件事
Suddenly I couldn't mention one thing in that school

277
00:09:52,522 --> 00:09:54,542
聽起來都像是雙關語
without it sounding like a double entendre.

278
00:09:54,542 --> 00:09:55,623
"睡覺"時間
Nap time?

279
00:09:56,052 --> 00:09:57,264
樂趣"地帶"
Fun zone?

280
00:09:58,553 --> 00:09:59,734
盒裝[陰部]果汁
Juice box...

281
00:10:00,523 --> 00:10:02,084
我有鮮嫩多汁的番茄呢
I got some nice tomatoes.

282
00:10:04,443 --> 00:10:05,364
好
Oh, yep.

283
00:10:06,853 --> 00:10:08,183
-你是不是弄灑了什么 -沒有
- Did you spill something? - Huh? No.

284
00:10:08,183 --> 00:10:10,153
我只是在很用心地做披薩
I'm just working hard on this pizza.

285
00:10:10,153 --> 00:10:12,583
我想我得把這個取下來
Guess I ought to take this off.

286
00:10:13,133 --> 00:10:14,643
天啊 沒了戒指感覺像裸體了一樣
Boy, feels naked without it.

287
00:10:14,643 --> 00:10:16,393
你有過這種感覺嗎 像裸體了一樣
You ever feel that way? Naked?

288
00:10:18,634 --> 00:10:22,444
我真心想相信喬有戴著他的眼罩
I really wanted to trust that Joe was wearing his eye patch,

289
00:10:22,444 --> 00:10:24,424
但是自從在垃圾箱里發現眼罩之后
but after finding it in the garbage,

290
00:10:24,424 --> 00:10:25,705
我必須得來確認
I had to make sure.

291
00:10:25,844 --> 00:10:29,244
我不想讓他把視力給毀了
I didn't want him to mess up his vision.

292
00:10:29,244 --> 00:10:31,774
我認為在這個國家 視力是一個很重要的問題
I think it's a big problem in this country.

293
00:10:31,774 --> 00:10:35,444
我所到之處 總有瞇著眼看的男人
Everywhere I look, there are men with googily eyes.

294
00:10:35,574 --> 00:10:36,634
我們來自拍吧
Let's take a selfie

295
00:10:36,634 --> 00:10:38,204
是給學校期刊拍的
for the school newsletter, so...

296
00:10:38,484 --> 00:10:40,575
所以顯出那對藍眼睛來
Flash those baby blues.

297
00:10:47,305 --> 00:10:48,565
你給我的烤箱[子宮]預熱了嗎
Did you preheat my oven?

298
00:10:48,565 --> 00:10:49,766
我不是故意的
Not on purpose.

299
00:10:53,265 --> 00:10:55,415
你剛才反應可真不小啊
Well, that was quite a little snitfit back there.

300
00:10:55,415 --> 00:10:57,415
你是想要讓我出丑 還是怎么了
Were you trying to embarrass me, or...?

301
00:10:57,415 --> 00:10:58,445
還能有讓你更出丑的事嗎
Mm, is that even possible?

302
00:10:58,445 --> 00:10:59,725
要贏過在餐廳唱歌
The singing in the restaurants,

303
00:10:59,725 --> 00:11:01,706
或者按摩時為廣告的"試音"可不容易啊
your Herbal Essence audition during the massage?

304
00:11:01,706 --> 00:11:03,816
你知道嗎 你才是應該羞愧的那個人
You know, you're the one who should be embarrassed.

305
00:11:03,816 --> 00:11:06,166
我的確感到了羞愧 這不正是吵架的原因嗎
I am. Isn't that what we're fighting about?

306
00:11:06,546 --> 00:11:08,026
看看你自己 你甚至不敢
Look at you. You can't even put on

307
00:11:08,026 --> 00:11:09,586
在男士換衣間里
your boxer-briefs in a men's locker room

308
00:11:09,586 --> 00:11:11,316
不用遮羞毛巾小短裙就穿上四角褲
without your little terrycloth shame skirt.

309
00:11:11,316 --> 00:11:12,876
這叫做有涵養 小卡
It's called modesty, Cam.

310
00:11:12,876 --> 00:11:14,256
你能把聲音放小點兒嗎
Can you please just keep your voice down?

311
00:11:14,256 --> 00:11:15,596
好吧 你知道嗎 這都是
Yeah, yeah. You know what? Well, it's all

312
00:11:15,596 --> 00:11:16,936
同樣的事
part of the same thing.

313
00:11:16,936 --> 00:11:18,686
你知道嗎 我一點都不尷尬
You know, I'm not embarrassing.

314
00:11:18,726 --> 00:11:20,746
你就是個無論做什么都會尷尬的人
You're the one that's just embarrassed by everything.

315
00:11:20,746 --> 00:11:21,978
簡直是神經病啊
That is crazy --

316
00:11:24,007 --> 00:11:25,927
-感覺這一撞很值得呢 -我很好
- This seems worth it. - I'm fine.

317
00:11:25,927 --> 00:11:28,137
不 你不好 而這影響了我們所有人
No, you're not, and it's affecting all of us.

318
00:11:28,137 --> 00:11:30,017
你總是讓我和莉莉閉嘴
You're constantly shushing Lily and me,

319
00:11:30,017 --> 00:11:32,207
責罵我們就因為我們活得大聲
scolding us just for living out loud.

320
00:11:32,227 --> 00:11:34,057
我們就不能晚點再說這件事嗎
Can we please have this conversation later?

321
00:11:34,057 --> 00:11:35,557
不 不能 因為我會忙著
No, we can't, because I'll be busy

322
00:11:35,557 --> 00:11:36,777
在父親節目中演出
performing in Fathers' Follies --

323
00:11:36,777 --> 00:11:38,867
另一件因為你太扭捏而不敢做的事
something else you're too self-conscious to do.

324
00:11:38,867 --> 00:11:40,787
你錯過了生活 米奇爾
You're missing out on life, Mitchell.

325
00:11:40,967 --> 00:11:43,388
你得不再那么拘束自己
You need to take off your shackles.

326
00:11:44,328 --> 00:11:45,789
讓人們看見
Let people see

327
00:11:46,138 --> 00:11:47,468
你是誰
who you are.

328
00:11:53,558 --> 00:11:57,178
我受夠了 閃躲的眼神 那些謊言
I've had enough -- the wandering eye, the lies.

329
00:11:57,518 --> 00:12:00,688
我為什么這么緊張 我什么都沒做錯
Why was I so nervous? I had done nothing wrong.

330
00:12:00,688 --> 00:12:03,739
好吧 我確實有開一些無害的郵件玩笑
Sure, I engaged in some friendly e-mail banter.

331
00:12:03,739 --> 00:12:06,569
我想我意識到了藍色衣服能襯托我的藍眼珠
I guess I realized blue shirts make my eyes sparkle.

332
00:12:06,569 --> 00:12:08,459
披薩派對開始前 也許還在停車場
Might have done a few push-ups in the parking lot

333
00:12:08,459 --> 00:12:11,269
做了幾個俯臥撐 但那是給所有人看的
before the pizza party, but that's for everybody.

334
00:12:11,269 --> 00:12:13,589
他就是把我當傻瓜
He's trying to make a fool of me.

335
00:12:13,899 --> 00:12:15,509
索尼婭 我得掛了
Sonia, I have to go.

336
00:12:17,299 --> 00:12:18,919
你一整天都到哪里去了
Where have you been all day?

337
00:12:18,919 --> 00:12:20,659
我明白你在暗示什么了 好吧
I see what you're implying. Fine.

338
00:12:20,659 --> 00:12:22,939
她的名字是勞拉 她對我來說什么都不是
Her name is Laura, she means nothing to me,

339
00:12:22,939 --> 00:12:25,110
我把婚戒取掉的唯一原因
and the only reason my wedding ring is off

340
00:12:25,110 --> 00:12:27,590
是我怕戒指丟在她的"面團"里
is 'cause I was afraid I would lose it in her dough.

341
00:12:27,800 --> 00:12:28,951
對不起
I'm sorry.

342
00:12:29,090 --> 00:12:30,650
你到底在說什么
What the hell are you talking about?

343
00:12:30,650 --> 00:12:33,050
幾封郵件 完全無害的小玩笑罷了
Couple of e-mails. Harmless stuff.

344
00:12:34,160 --> 00:12:37,190
"把車停在秋千那 好幫你把東西拿進來"
"Park by the swings so I can help you carry stuff in."

345
00:12:37,790 --> 00:12:39,050
你就在擔心這些啊
These are what you're worrying about?

346
00:12:39,050 --> 00:12:39,990
這些什么都不是啊
There's nothing there.

347
00:12:39,990 --> 00:12:41,200
是嗎 米奇和小卡在暗示
Yeah, Mitch and Cam were implying

348
00:12:41,200 --> 00:12:42,770
我跟她之間有不尋常的事情
there was something weird going on.

349
00:12:42,770 --> 00:12:43,630
怎么可能嘛
That's crazy.

350
00:12:43,630 --> 00:12:45,200
她才35歲 還貌美如花
She's, like, 35 and gorgeous.

351
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:46,462
就是啊
Exactly.

352
00:12:47,401 --> 00:12:49,211
不過 我想你念郵件時
Although, I don't think you read that e-mail

353
00:12:49,211 --> 00:12:50,581
沒念出它本身的語氣
the only way it could have been read.

354
00:12:50,581 --> 00:12:51,682
其實是這種語氣
I mean, it could've gone,

355
00:12:51,771 --> 00:12:52,831
"把車停在秋千那
"Park by the swings

356
00:12:52,831 --> 00:12:56,401
好幫你把東西拿"進"來"
so I can help you carry stuff in."

357
00:12:56,651 --> 00:12:58,961
聽上去她知道你背不好
Sounds like she knows about your bad back.

358
00:12:58,961 --> 00:13:01,681
杰 小撩一下無傷大雅
Jay, there's no harm in a little flirting,

359
00:13:01,681 --> 00:13:03,921
-特別是你 -此話怎講
- especially you. - What is that supposed to mean?

360
00:13:03,921 --> 00:13:06,962
你是個好人 你體內自帶警報系統
You're a good man. You have, like, a built-in alarm system.

361
00:13:06,962 --> 00:13:08,862
不會讓你行差踏錯
It keeps you in the right path.

362
00:13:08,862 --> 00:13:10,622
那你在學校為什么那樣瞪我
Then why did you shoot me that look at school?

363
00:13:10,622 --> 00:13:12,263
我那是在瞪喬
It was meant for Joe.

364
00:13:12,522 --> 00:13:15,422
我擔心他沒有你那種強烈的道德心
I worry that he doesn't have your strong conscience.

365
00:13:15,422 --> 00:13:17,992
我害怕他遺傳了我家的基因
I worry that he has my family genes

366
00:13:17,992 --> 00:13:20,462
我們說謊都不打草稿
where we can lie and lie and lie and lie

367
00:13:20,462 --> 00:13:22,612
而且不會有絲毫愧疚
without feeling one ounce of guilt.

368
00:13:22,612 --> 00:13:24,592
但你平時沒對我說謊吧
Y-You don't lie to me, though, do you?

369
00:13:24,592 --> 00:13:25,743
從沒有過
Never.

370
00:13:29,313 --> 00:13:31,503
他來了 我猜他一定會進來
Here he is now. I'll bet he comes in here

371
00:13:31,503 --> 00:13:33,233
為自己說謊道歉
and apologizes for lying.

372
00:13:33,233 --> 00:13:35,313
前提是他遺傳了你們家的正直基因
Yeah, if he's like one from your family.

373
00:13:35,313 --> 00:13:37,773
但如果他進來 像個沒事人一樣
But if he walks in here all easy-breezy

374
00:13:37,773 --> 00:13:40,203
假裝自己沒做錯過任何事
pretending that he didn't do anything wrong,

375
00:13:40,203 --> 00:13:41,973
那他就是百分百拉米雷茲家的人
he's 100% Ramirez,

376
00:13:42,423 --> 00:13:44,483
或者這也不是我們真正的姓
or whatever our real name is.

377
00:13:46,253 --> 00:13:47,324
兒子
Hey, buddy.

378
00:13:47,973 --> 00:13:49,359
對不起 行了嗎
I'm sorry, okay?!

379
00:13:49,359 --> 00:13:51,704
戴眼罩的事我說謊了
I lied about wearing my eye patch,

380
00:13:51,704 --> 00:13:53,574
那還只是一系列謊言的開始
and that's only the beginning!

381
00:13:53,574 --> 00:13:55,704
我自行車怎么壞的 我說謊了
I lied about how my bike broke.

382
00:13:55,704 --> 00:13:57,134
我從沒遛過斯黛拉
I never walk Stella.

383
00:13:57,134 --> 00:13:58,874
我把她拴在跑步機上
I tie her to the treadmill.

384
00:13:58,874 --> 00:14:00,784
我之前放在枕頭底下的三顆掉牙
The last three teeth I put under my pillow

385
00:14:00,784 --> 00:14:01,954
其實都是薄荷糖
were Tic-Tacs.

386
00:14:01,954 --> 00:14:03,544
我是個無可救藥的男孩
I'm a terrible boy.

387
00:14:03,544 --> 00:14:04,834
太好了
Oh, good.

388
00:14:04,834 --> 00:14:06,564
他跟你一樣軟弱
He's weak like you.

389
00:14:08,424 --> 00:14:10,385
謝謝你 蒂凡尼的爸爸
Thank you, Tiffany's dad!

390
00:14:10,385 --> 00:14:12,905
接下來 請掌聲歡迎
And now, please put your hands together

391
00:14:12,905 --> 00:14:15,805
莉莉 哈珀 扎克和丹妮爾的爸爸們
for Lily, Harper, Zack, and Danielle's dads --

392
00:14:15,805 --> 00:14:17,745
"蜜蜂之膝[生意]"組合
The Bees Knees!

393
00:14:22,255 --> 00:14:24,015
爸爸加油
Go, Dad! Woot, woot!

394
00:14:24,285 --> 00:14:26,345
我是觀眾席里唯一的爸爸
I was the only dad in the audience.

395
00:14:26,345 --> 00:14:28,965
臺下坐著的都是女性和孩子 就我一個男人
It was just me and a bunch of women and children.

396
00:14:28,965 --> 00:14:31,266
我感覺自己就像硬擠上救生艇的懦夫
I felt like a coward on a life boat.

397
00:14:31,266 --> 00:14:33,666
小卡說得對 我錯過了很多
I mean, Cam was right -- I-I was missing out.

398
00:14:33,776 --> 00:14:35,746
鮑勃 幫我個小忙
Hey, Bob. A quick favor to ask.

399
00:14:35,746 --> 00:14:37,196
如果哈珀不介意
If you don't think Harper would mind,

400
00:14:37,196 --> 00:14:39,436
你能不能把蜜蜂表演服給我穿一下
do you think maybe I could wear the bee costume?

401
00:14:39,436 --> 00:14:41,416
拿去吧 反正我之后還有表演
Take it. I'm in the show later anyways,

402
00:14:41,416 --> 00:14:43,316
在"感恩之父"組合里唱低音部
playing bass with the Grateful Dads.

403
00:14:43,456 --> 00:14:44,607
那就給我吧
Then good, yeah.

404
00:14:52,036 --> 00:14:53,927
天啊 我真為你感到驕傲
Oh, my God. I'm so proud of you!

405
00:15:01,517 --> 00:15:03,557
謝謝 謝謝各位
Thank you. Thank you!

406
00:15:03,557 --> 00:15:05,227
現在請大家安靜片刻
And now we'd like to take a moment

407
00:15:05,227 --> 00:15:07,587
我們一起緬懷親愛的食堂阿姨
to remember our beloved lunch lady,

408
00:15:07,647 --> 00:15:09,257
佩妮·米勒太太
Mrs. Penny Miller.

409
00:15:12,187 --> 00:15:13,538
老天
Oh, my gosh.

410
00:15:13,538 --> 00:15:15,018
你居然這么做了
I can't believe you did that!

411
00:15:15,018 --> 00:15:18,308
-太棒了 -哎呀別夸了
- That was amazing! - Oh, stop it.

412
00:15:19,948 --> 00:15:20,819
不
No!

413
00:15:22,768 --> 00:15:23,749
天啊
Oh, God.

414
00:15:25,768 --> 00:15:27,555
我們還沒吸取手套的教訓嗎
Did we learn nothing from the gloves?!

415
00:15:27,555 --> 00:15:32,668
抱歉 抱歉 抱歉 我來 我來
Sorry, sorry, sorry. I got it. I got it.

416
00:15:32,668 --> 00:15:34,418
我來弄 我來處理
I got it. I got it. I got it.

417
00:15:36,179 --> 00:15:37,279
頭盤
For starters,

418
00:15:37,279 --> 00:15:39,089
是用我祖母配方做的意大利餃子
my grandmother's ravioli.

419
00:15:39,089 --> 00:15:40,079
看起來很好吃
It looks amazing.

420
00:15:40,079 --> 00:15:42,029
我房間里存著一些紅酒 以備不時之需
I've been saving some occasion wine in my room.

421
00:15:42,029 --> 00:15:43,969
盒子上的葡萄特性一欄寫著"媽媽咪呀"
The grape character on the box is saying "Mamma Mia!"

422
00:15:43,969 --> 00:15:45,999
所以應該跟意大利料理很搭
so it should go well with Italian.

423
00:15:52,379 --> 00:15:53,820
教授 您好
Hello, Professor.

424
00:15:54,649 --> 00:15:55,551
我...
I, uh...

425
00:15:56,290 --> 00:15:59,100
看來你接受了我提議的"門戶開放政策"
I see you took me up on that open-door policy I mentioned.

426
00:15:59,100 --> 00:16:02,070
我不是來問你學習的事
Oh, I'm not here for office hours.

427
00:16:02,070 --> 00:16:04,420
-這是個約會 -毫不意外
- This is a date. - Of course.

428
00:16:04,420 --> 00:16:06,320
我聽說披頭士樂隊的保羅·麥卡尼當紅時
I've heard things like this happened to Paul McCartney

429
00:16:06,320 --> 00:16:07,600
也遇到過這種事
at the height of his Beatles fame.

430
00:16:07,600 --> 00:16:09,780
典型的《致命誘惑》套路
It was a classic fatal-attraction situation.

431
00:16:09,780 --> 00:16:10,780
我必須做兩件事
I had to do two things.

432
00:16:10,780 --> 00:16:12,630
第一 撐過接下來的十分鐘
One -- get through the next 10 minutes

433
00:16:12,630 --> 00:16:14,430
拖到棄我課的截止時間過了為止
'til the deadline to drop my class had passed

434
00:16:14,430 --> 00:16:16,310
方法是用詼諧的玩笑轉移她的注意力
by distracting her with light banter

435
00:16:16,310 --> 00:16:18,921
和享用她做的托斯卡納料理 第二
and enjoying her Tuscan cooking, and, two --

436
00:16:18,921 --> 00:16:22,011
確認下她有沒有暴打克萊爾并把她綁了起來
check to see if she had beaten and restrained Claire.

437
00:16:22,111 --> 00:16:24,041
我會不會用力過猛了
I'm not coming on too strongly,

438
00:16:24,041 --> 00:16:25,891
穿這條裙子來約會
am I, with this dress?

439
00:16:26,371 --> 00:16:27,282
不會
Oh. No.

440
00:16:28,291 --> 00:16:29,201
很可愛
Lovely.

441
00:16:29,201 --> 00:16:31,541
我對自己的烹飪很沒自信
I'm really nervous about my cooking.

442
00:16:31,541 --> 00:16:33,121
如果一個男人沒有吃光
If a guy doesn't eat every bite

443
00:16:33,121 --> 00:16:34,781
我祖母的意大利餃子
of my grandma's ravioli,

444
00:16:34,781 --> 00:16:36,012
我會發瘋
I go nuts.

445
00:16:36,061 --> 00:16:39,012
我們當然
Well, we certainly...

446
00:16:39,202 --> 00:16:41,312
不希望有這種事發生
don't want that to happen,

447
00:16:41,312 --> 00:16:42,173
對吧
do we?

448
00:16:42,502 --> 00:16:43,743
話說
Now, uh...

449
00:16:43,772 --> 00:16:44,803
你是哪里人
where are you from?

450
00:16:45,422 --> 00:16:46,552
老家在哪里
Originally.

451
00:16:46,552 --> 00:16:47,822
我猜是意大利
I would say Italy,

452
00:16:47,822 --> 00:16:49,072
但你沒有口音
but there's no accent,

453
00:16:49,072 --> 00:16:51,362
所以你肯定不是
so, obviously, that's not the case.

454
00:16:52,152 --> 00:16:53,102
盧克
Luke.

455
00:16:53,102 --> 00:16:55,392
盧克 我關于門羅主義那篇論文有消息了嗎
Luke, any word on my Monroe Doctrine paper?

456
00:16:55,392 --> 00:16:56,562
其實 我決定
Oh, actually, I decided

457
00:16:56,562 --> 00:16:57,692
不棄那門課了
not to drop that class,

458
00:16:57,692 --> 00:16:59,793
所以把論文交上去好像不太好
so it didn't feel right turning it in.

459
00:16:59,793 --> 00:17:00,973
不過發生了有趣的事
But something funny did happen.

460
00:17:00,973 --> 00:17:02,373
我在電腦上打開了你寫的論文
I had your paper open on my computer.

461
00:17:02,373 --> 00:17:03,823
佩奇看到了 以為是我寫的
Paige saw it and thought it was mine.

462
00:17:03,823 --> 00:17:05,264
她做了一些很棒的改動
She made some really good changes.

463
00:17:05,273 --> 00:17:06,853
-改動 -是啊
- Changes? - Yeah, well,

464
00:17:06,853 --> 00:17:08,413
她在幾個地方直接切入正題
she cut to the chase in a few places,

465
00:17:08,413 --> 00:17:09,663
把結尾部分做了精簡
cleaned up the ending.

466
00:17:09,663 --> 00:17:11,223
她其實是歷史專業的學生呢
She's a history major, you know.

467
00:17:11,223 --> 00:17:13,073
-懂了 -媽 我...
- Get it. - Mom, I'm...

468
00:17:13,073 --> 00:17:14,603
跟人家還在晚餐約會中呢
kind of in the middle of a dinner date.

469
00:17:14,603 --> 00:17:15,903
是嗎 如果你繼續約會
Are you? By now you might be

470
00:17:15,903 --> 00:17:17,303
你們說不定電影已經看一半 或者在玩桌游了
in the middle of a movie or a board game.

471
00:17:17,303 --> 00:17:19,013
畢竟我們都知道她這人有多愛做改變
We all know how obsessed she is with changing things.

472
00:17:19,013 --> 00:17:20,464
去把論文給我拿來 盧克
Go get the paper, Luke.

473
00:17:22,514 --> 00:17:24,124
太好了 你沒事
Oh, good, you're okay.

474
00:17:24,124 --> 00:17:25,564
誰說老娘沒事了
I'm not that okay.

475
00:17:25,564 --> 00:17:27,854
我對這佩奇可不太感冒
I'm not a fan of this Paige.

476
00:17:27,854 --> 00:17:29,614
-她挺狗膽包天 -所以你知道了
- She's got some nerve. - So you're aware.

477
00:17:29,664 --> 00:17:31,104
我當然知道 我清楚知道她毫不介意
Oh, I'm aware. I'm aware that she has no problem

478
00:17:31,104 --> 00:17:32,584
把自己的賤爪伸向
putting her grubby, little paws all over

479
00:17:32,584 --> 00:17:34,034
不屬于她的事物上
something that doesn't belong to her.

480
00:17:34,034 --> 00:17:35,914
-我看出你很不爽 -是的
- I can see you're upset. - I am.

481
00:17:35,914 --> 00:17:37,984
我不爽的原因是因為
I'm upset because I basically took

482
00:17:37,984 --> 00:17:41,655
我把史上最無聊的東西拿來并弄得有趣
the most boring thing in history and made it interesting.

483
00:17:41,815 --> 00:17:43,735
她大搖大擺走過來就當成自己的東西拿走
She thinks she can just come in here and just make it hers.

484
00:17:43,735 --> 00:17:44,945
-做夢吧 -我有點被傷到
- No. - Feels a little hurtful,

485
00:17:44,945 --> 00:17:47,435
但她是我的學生 這事對我影響巨大
but she is my student, and I have a lot at stake here,

486
00:17:47,435 --> 00:17:49,525
能求你把這件事留給我自己處理嗎
so can I please just handle this myself?

487
00:17:52,065 --> 00:17:54,445
你沒吃到意大利餃也不算虧
You didn't miss much with the ravioli.

488
00:17:54,445 --> 00:17:56,665
真正的好戲是我的海鱸魚
The showstopper is my branzino.

489
00:17:56,665 --> 00:17:57,585
聞起來好香啊
It smells great.

490
00:17:57,585 --> 00:17:59,075
我們家平常沒機會吃到魚
We don't get to have fish around here.

491
00:17:59,075 --> 00:18:00,065
我爸超討厭吃魚
My dad hates it.

492
00:18:00,065 --> 00:18:01,615
這是我們的家傳食譜
Well, this one's a family recipe,

493
00:18:01,615 --> 00:18:04,826
如果你不愛吃 我可能就得拋棄你了
so if you don't like it, I'll pretty much have to drop you.

494
00:18:05,306 --> 00:18:06,227
既然如此
Well...

495
00:18:07,136 --> 00:18:08,256
那我們還是
let's not have

496
00:18:08,256 --> 00:18:09,657
不要再說
any of that

497
00:18:09,886 --> 00:18:11,207
任何瘋話了
crazy...talk.

498
00:18:11,676 --> 00:18:13,406
離時限還有2分鐘
Two minutes to deadline.

499
00:18:13,406 --> 00:18:15,296
我不能讓她棄了我的課
I couldn't let her drop my class!

500
00:18:17,526 --> 00:18:18,487
現在
Now

501
00:18:18,976 --> 00:18:20,816
繼續
...back...

502
00:18:22,176 --> 00:18:23,378
說你是從哪里來的
... to where you're from.

503
00:18:23,797 --> 00:18:24,838
加州恩西諾
Encino.

504
00:18:27,107 --> 00:18:28,048
靠
Damn it.

505
00:18:28,287 --> 00:18:29,757
媽 別生她氣 她只是...
Mom, don't be mad at her. She was just --

506
00:18:29,757 --> 00:18:31,217
沒 她真的改良了許多
No, she made it better.

507
00:18:31,217 --> 00:18:32,977
我寫這句的時候腦子里想什么呢
What was I thinking with this sentence?

508
00:18:32,977 --> 00:18:35,537
"受人敬仰的大律師的論點
"The esteemed barrister's argument was as layered

509
00:18:35,537 --> 00:18:38,067
充滿層次 仿佛他的晚宴后馬褲一般"
as the cuffs on his after-dinner breeches"?

510
00:18:38,067 --> 00:18:40,407
這是我第三次提到馬褲了
That is the third time I mentioned breeches.

511
00:18:40,407 --> 00:18:41,677
我當年是在鬧哪樣啊
What was I going through?

512
00:18:41,677 --> 00:18:43,267
-我可以走了嗎 -可以
- Can I go now? - Yeah.

513
00:18:43,697 --> 00:18:44,899
等等 寶貝
Oh, wait, honey.

514
00:18:45,718 --> 00:18:47,408
我覺得這姑娘挺好
I like this girl for you.

515
00:18:47,468 --> 00:18:49,538
她值得你請她喝比盒裝紅酒更好的酒
She deserves better than boxed wine.

516
